[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-queen-elizabeth-commonwealth-scholarship-2026-qecs-fully-funded-opportunity-131":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},131,"queen-elizabeth-commonwealth-scholarship-2026-qecs-fully-funded-opportunity-131","Queen Elizabeth Commonwealth Scholarship 2026 (qecs): Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>Have you wondered what the Queen Elizabeth Commonwealth Scholarship entails?\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Queen Elizabeth Commonwealth Scholarship is a fully funded opportunity sponsored by the UK Government to provide talented students from any corner of the Commonwealth with a chance to earn a Master’s degree.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>As a Queen Elizabeth Commonwealth Scholarship holder, you will get sponsorship for the coverage of tuition fees, living stipends, research costs, and the costs of your flight ticket to and from your hone country.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Beyond academic pursuits, the program encourages the development of new skills, offers exposure to life in a different country, and facilitates the building of global networks.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>If you are ready to embark on a journey of academic excellence, cultural exchange, and global networking, this scholarship is your gateway to a transformative experience.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Queen Elizabeth Commonwealth Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: UK Government\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-africa\u002F\">Study-In-Africa\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-asia\u002F\">Study-In-Asia\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visa\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical Insurance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Commonwealth Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: June 3, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Queen Elizabeth Scholarship 2026 Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Queen Elizabeth Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a citizen or possess a refugee status in a Commonwealth country\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be in the final year or have completed an undergraduate degree at an accredited university\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Satisfy the requirements of the program and the university offering the course.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You must have obtained a 2:1 to be able to apply for the scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply on or before the deadline\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Queen Elizabeth Commonwealth Scholarship Benefits and Timeline\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Queen Elizabeth Commonwealth Scholarships offer a transformative experience marked by cultural exchange and academic collaboration in unique global environments. The award includes:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fully-funded tuition fees\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living expenses (stipend) for the duration of the award\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Return economy flight\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>One-off arrival allowance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Research support grant (on request)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Duration of Programme:\u003C\u002Fstrong> 2 years\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Required Documents for The Queen Elizabeth Commonwealth Scholarships (QECS) 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Personal details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic &amp; employment record\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Course at host university details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Statements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Upload supporting documents (including \u003Cstrong>2\u003C\u002Fstrong> references)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.acu.ac.uk\u002Ffunding-opportunities\u002Ffor-students\u002Fscholarships\u002Fqueen-elizabeth-commonwealth-scholarships\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.acu.ac.uk\u002Ffunding-opportunities\u002Ffor-students\u002Fscholarships\u002Fqueen-elizabeth-commonwealth-scholarships\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-10 16:53:13",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fqueen-elizabeth-commonwealth-scholarship-2026-qecs-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69d91ce914e257.31324788_screenshot 2026-04-10 164719.png","image","","h